Package: cfimport
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Cloudflare Import Tool
 cfimport is a command-line tool for importing and exporting
 Cloudflare configurations and resources.
 .
 Features:
  - Import/export DNS records
  - Import/export firewall rules
  - Import/export page rules
  - Support for multiple file formats (JSON, YAML, BIND, CSV)
  - Dry-run mode for previewing changes
  - Backup and restore configurations
